WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Explore Data Lookup. Use Dev Tools > Data Lookup to understand the contract without sending a request.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Choose an endpoint. Search by endpoint or operation name, such as Create origination.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Compare request and response. Read required fields, types and the example response status.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Expand nested fields. Money includes an amount and a currency. Requiredness applies within its parent.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Click a field to look it up. Field lookup opens the exact path with the integration and endpoint selected.

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Search another field. Use the Field selector to find risk_policy_version_id.

7
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Read the definition and source. Review type, requiredness and considerations, then follow Field reference.
